00:08:46,000 --> 00:08:51,920
the guest operating system and allocates 
frames on the physical memory then you  

81
00:08:51,920 --> 00:08:57,280
have the file system and as we said this can 
actually be a file that is maintained by the  

82
00:08:58,160 --> 00:09:04,000
hypervisor so with checkpointing and 
snapshotting the idea is that since the very  

83
00:09:04,560 --> 00:09:12,160
